                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-a2c09568-7c70-41a6-8dac-11f778473c53" type="punctum" xml:id="m-3c59ebfd-e198-4ab1-988c-cdfdd88055a9">
                    <nc xml:id="m-596e2223-00b1-4d61-8dee-a636d09624ba" pname="g" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-b029f697-abbb-43ac-91b6-1b4efa140035" />
                    </nc>
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-6fc6a24f-f124-499a-ade3-034a46442a1c" facs="#m-6c99a38a-bf45-4ae9-b61b-eff61241d7e0" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-56a88817-50bc-4492-9647-176cd3a786fa">
              <lg xml:id="m-8f0aca3a-00ed-42ea-a2a8-66d9f17fc44f">
                <l xml:id="m-f58ef9b6-e738-407c-95ef-5db8ab8caa84" facs="#m-9d76ae39-2a2f-4706-a0de-7d5164c499b8" label="ambiguous">100</l><l xml:id="m-f1a00580-edf9-4867-8f87-3dc8062965ea" facs="#m-f0734fa5-47ba-4a02-af74-dc0343b37af8" label="text-like">The Common Tones of the Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-3db8096b-a0af-4ba6-94e4-f205fc73195e" facs="#m-aa893a8d-b7f7-4023-a329-5e3629241728" label="text-like">Ancient Tones ad libitum.</l><l xml:id="m-216ef115-5437-409f-a102-759a1b8ff8b1" facs="#m-5ccdf963-2d45-46e3-98ac-cd9a741bc0e2" label="ambiguous">a) Solemn Tone.</l><l xml:id="m-3769c969-e60a-4722-84f2-d127b219a25e" facs="#m-0e24dcdd-c870-4dc9-acad-42391aa35a5f" label="lyrics-like">All the Prayers of the Mass (except the Prayer Super pópulum) may be</l><l xml:id="m-3c604e33-b474-4f8f-ab5d-105b35915415" facs="#m-13b66d99-7fdc-4517-88b3-6f7be0204bf2" label="text-like">sung in this tone without distinction as to festal or ferial rite.</l><l xml:id="m-bc1adcda-69ea-4f4b-a540-3a4347aecae2" facs="#m-813d7ecb-af04-405c-af29-c2024329d9f7" label="lyrics-like">Ominus vobíscum. [Pax vó-bis.] R. Et cum spíri-tu tú-o.</l><l xml:id="m-88eaa2d0-5cd5-499f-a79b-19a00da9783b" facs="#m-51022b14-1eba-4beb-a8cb-8d46c08b9ad6" label="ambiguous">Flex.</l><l xml:id="m-16977b8a-cf02-4357-8f04-4a2fec74041c" facs="#m-2c0406bc-37bb-461b-ac21-e0823892a186" label="lyrics-like">U-rémus. Ma-jestá-tem tú-am Dómine suppli-ci-ter exorámus:</l><l xml:id="m-435e8156-f3dc-49e8-b6e0-1a61af04d62d" facs="#m-b01ea83b-b531-4fa4-b90c-9ef8c3f62970" label="lyrics-like">ut sicut Ecclé-si-ae tú-ae be-átus André-as Apósto- lus éxsti-tit prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-34d14600-b2ec-4f75-a4ee-1586472b0ea7" facs="#m-e2bb8353-02bb-4459-a427-9938056a8ed7" label="ambiguous">Full stop.</l><l xml:id="m-e87de7bd-8d60-4c79-8a36-6de0c577dbf0" facs="#m-f9aa863b-7c94-4b0e-94de-452989741722" label="lyrics-like">di-cátor et réctor; i-ta apud te sit pro nóbis perpétu-us intercéssor.</l><l xml:id="m-61b98fa7-a318-432a-9fdd-7b07d79e774d" facs="#m-7c68ce0a-4bc9-4364-94a6-f93069ceb26f" label="ambiguous">Flex.</l><l xml:id="m-11da3f82-0c7f-41c7-9511-0398e4861b97" facs="#m-74d54bea-6148-4f86-a78b-23132c6ec595" label="lyrics-like">Per Dominum nóstrum Jésum Christum Fi-li-um tú-um: qui técum</l><l xml:id="m-7d18ce59-01eb-4403-9356-82f83c15d8f4" facs="#m-91987441-7cbd-4f86-847f-7946d073b6ce" label="ambiguous">Metrum.</l><l xml:id="m-9ba46ad5-1007-4d91-a675-937a9f694c57" facs="#m-dff1a9e9-52ac-4e47-8e84-cf0665442a78" label="lyrics-like">ví-vit et regnat in uni-tá-te Spíri-tus Sáncti Dé-us, per ómni-a saé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e778647a-66fb-4c28-807e-8c1b92ef823d" facs="#m-d76e46b9-9a1e-4bc6-a52d-40cd3ba84024" label="lyrics-like">cu-la saecu-ló-rum. K. Amen. Another conclusion: Qui vi-vis et régnas</l><l xml:id="m-ffc0f48f-d1d7-4374-94c5-7234238e5add" facs="#m-10b95e8c-a281-48b1-b30a-02c3e7d47086" label="lyrics-like">cum Dé-o Pâtre lor Qui técum ví-vit et régnatl in uni-tâ-te Spk-ri-tus</l><l xml:id="m-519a2e37-eaed-4c5a-8608-224fe8a51d65" facs="#m-80248257-750a-4565-8e7d-2023a0e23d18" label="lyrics-like">Sáncti Dé-us, etc.</l><l xml:id="m-1cccf458-01c3-4db1-9924-918886fb729f" facs="#m-438c6c0c-23a1-4fc7-8645-4f38951f1485" label="text-like">Examples of the Flex.</l><l xml:id="m-8fef2453-3571-41c3-9376-f26d3d3eda11" facs="#m-11c19a4c-c863-4f80-b011-7c0038278baa" label="lyrics-like">pré-ci-bus nóstris ac-cómmo¬ da.</l><l xml:id="m-09b2e67d-84cb-496c-9c57-61e9c0f1e1b5" facs="#m-fbace3fa-09c9-401b-88e4-b781fbf41b67" label="ambiguous">af- fli¬ gi¬</l><l xml:id="m-7de019b9-addb-489d-bc40-1c0c5535e326" facs="#m-c87b353c-f4d4-4b3d-981d-42a7d9e650e1" label="ambiguous">mur.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>